{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q420188","formula":"C₁₇H₂₁NO₄","hill":"C17H21NO4","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":17.0,"H":21.0,"N":1.0,"O":4.0},"names":{"en":"Fenoterol","ru":"Фенотерол","uk":"Фенотерол"},"descriptions":{"en":"Fenoterol is a β2-adrenergic receptor agonist and bronchodilator medication used in the treatment of asthma. Fenoterol is produced and sold by Boehringer Ingelheim as Berotec N and in combination with ipratropium as Berodual N. It was patented in 1962 and came into medical use in 1971, but in the 1980s concerns emerged about its safety and its use being associated with an increased risk of death.","ru":"Фенотерол (Fenoterolum)*. 1-(3,5-Диоксифенил)-2-(пара-окси-a-метил-фенетиламино)-этанол. Выпускается в виде гидробромида.","uk":"Фенотерол (англ. Fenoterol, лат. Fenoterolum) — синтетичний препарат, що належить по хімічній структурі до фенілзаміщених β-аміноспиртів, та застосовується як місцево (інгаляційно, у тому числі в небулайзерах), так і перорально та парентерально."},"fame":19,"pubchemCid":3343,"mass":303.35,"charge":0,"smiles":"CC(CC1=CC=C(C=C1)O)NCC(C2=CC(=CC(=C2)O)O)O","inchikey":"LSLYOANBFKQKPT-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"5-[1-hydroxy-2-[1-(4-hydroxyphenyl)propan-2-ylamino]ethyl]benzene-1,3-diol","classes":[{"qid":"Q59199015","names":{"en":"group of stereoisomers","ru":"группа стереоизомеров","uk":"група стереоізомерів"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"3343","atoms":43,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-2.251,"y":0.898,"z":-2.218,"el":"O"},{"x":-5.041,"y":-2.889,"z":-0.046,"el":"O"},{"x":-6.44,"y":1.354,"z":1.634,"el":"O"},{"x":7.561,"y":-0.993,"z":1.177,"el":"O"},{"x":0.246,"y":0.987,"z":-0.791,"el":"N"},{"x":1.454,"y":0.354,"z":-0.252,"el":"C"},{"x":2.698,"y":1.074,"z":-0.802,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.947,"y":0.365,"z":-0.239,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.214,"y":1.025,"z":-0.798,"el":"C"},{"x":1.424,"y":-1.13,"z":-0.619,"el":"C"},{"x":4.0,"y":0.521,"z":-0.